# --- Katalon build output (each project's own .gitignore covers the same folders) ---
**/bin/
**/Libs/
**/Reports/
**/.gradle/
**/build/
**/.cache/
**/.classpath
**/.project

# --- Local / CI tooling output ---
katalon-reports/
*.log

# --- Private execution profiles: keep real credentials out of git ---
# Create e.g. "<project>/Profiles/local.glbl" and run with -executionProfile="local"
**/Profiles/local*.glbl
**/Profiles/*.secret.glbl

# --- Local fixtures with personal data (commit only *.example.json templates) ---
**/Include/resources/fixtures/*.json
!**/Include/resources/fixtures/*.example.json
